            "review_title": "Review at BA GAC nuong & bia",
            "review_text": "Inspire65210289396\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of the places to go to with friends and family\nAug 2023 • Friends\nIf you need a place to gather friends and family, I find Ba Gac is a great suggestion. Especially at Ba Gac Quang Trung branch, my friends and I eat and drink in the airy space of the rooftop, chatting comfortably without affecting other tables.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 1, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
